diff --git a/saas/README.md b/saas/README.md
index 28b0891..898469e 100644
--- a/saas/README.md
+++ b/saas/README.md
@@ -40,6 +40,18 @@ bin/dev # You need to start the dev server in the same terminal session
 
 This will ask for your 1password authorization to read and set the environment variables that Stripe needs.
 
+### Billing
+
+Plans live in `app/models/plan.rb`: Free (1,000 cards, 1 GB), Unlimited ($20/month, 5 GB) and Unlimited+ ($25/month, 500 GB). Free accounts that run out of cards can still draft, but publishing and creating cards through the API are refused.
+
+Stripe hosts Checkout and the customer portal, and posts subscription changes to `/stripe/webhooks`, which keeps `Account::Subscription` in sync. Subscribe the endpoint to `checkout.session.completed` and the `customer.subscription.*` events. The app reads:
+
+* `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`
+* `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`
+* `STRIPE_MONTHLY_V1_PRICE_ID` (Unlimited) and `STRIPE_MONTHLY_EXTRA_STORAGE_V1_PRICE_ID` (Unlimited+)
+
+Support tools are at `/admin/accounts`: comp or uncomp an account (comped accounts get Unlimited), and override the card count and bytes used that limits are enforced against.
+
 ### Stripe environments
 
 * [Development](https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1SdTFtRus34tgjsJ/test/dashboard)
diff --git a/saas/app/controllers/account/billing_portals_controller.rb b/saas/app/controllers/account/billing_portals_controller.rb
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f566728
--- /dev/null
+++ b/saas/app/controllers/account/billing_portals_controller.rb
@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+class Account::BillingPortalsController < ApplicationController
+  include StripeUnreachable
+
+  before_action :ensure_admin
+  before_action :ensure_billing_customer
+
+  def show
+    portal = Stripe::BillingPortal::Session.create(portal_params)
+    redirect_to portal.url, allow_other_host: true, status: :see_other
+  end
+
+  private
+    def ensure_billing_customer
+      redirect_to main_app.account_settings_path unless Current.account.subscription&.stripe_customer_id
+    end
+
+    def portal_params
+      { customer: Current.account.subscription.stripe_customer_id, return_url: main_app.account_settings_url }.tap do |params|
+        params[:flow_data] = plan_change_flow if plan_change?
+      end
+    end
+
+    def plan_change?
+      params[:plan_key].present? && Current.account.subscribed? && Current.account.subscription.stripe_subscription_id.present?
+    end
+
+    def plan_change_flow
+      { type: "subscription_update", subscription: Current.account.subscription.stripe_subscription_id }
+    end
+end
diff --git a/saas/app/controllers/account/subscriptions_controller.rb b/saas/app/controllers/account/subscriptions_controller.rb
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..286e51c
